<p begin="00:48:49.766" end="00:48:51.366" style="s2">Then you&#39;d better watch closely.</p>
<p begin="00:48:55.400" end="00:48:57.166" style="s2">People versus Spencer Hale.</p>
<p begin="00:48:57.433" end="00:48:59.933" style="s2">The defense moves to throw out the camera footage.</p>
<p begin="00:49:00.166" end="00:49:01.766" style="s2">Ms. Lennox is here as a witness.</p>
<p begin="00:49:05.933" end="00:49:09.466" style="s2">Your Honor, according to Ms. Lennox&#39;s sworn</p>
<p begin="00:49:09.633" end="00:49:11.966" style="s2">statement and an independent analysis,</p>
<p begin="00:49:12.400" end="00:49:15.433" style="s2">this memory card spent a night in the hands</p>
<p begin="00:49:15.433" end="00:49:18.833" style="s2">of a man expelled from college for theft</p>
<p begin="00:49:18.833" end="00:49:21.166" style="s2">and a housekeeper with a stake in this estate.</p>
<p begin="00:49:21.666" end="00:49:23.233" style="s2">The timestamps have gaps.</p>
<p begin="00:49:23.566" end="00:49:25.366" style="s2">We move to exclude the footage entirely.</p>
<p begin="00:49:27.600" end="00:49:30.200" style="s2">The camera only records when something moves.</p>
<p begin="00:49:31.033" end="00:49:33.000" style="s2">The company&#39;s motion log shows</p>
<p begin="00:49:33.033" end="00:49:35.400" style="s2">nothing moved during those gaps.</p>
<p begin="00:49:36.600" end="00:49:38.800" style="s2">And every clip went up</p>
<p begin="00:49:38.800" end="00:49:40.666" style="s2">to their server the second it was recorded.</p>
<p begin="00:49:42.933" end="00:49:43.866" style="s2">Until last weekend,</p>
<p begin="00:49:43.866" end="00:49:46.066" style="s2">nobody had logged into that account in three years.</p>
<p begin="00:49:47.133" end="00:49:48.766" style="s2">Their engineer certified it.</p>
<p begin="00:49:48.866" end="00:49:51.433" style="s2">The server copy matches the card frame for frame.</p>
<p begin="00:49:55.166" end="00:49:56.466" style="s2">The footage comes in.</p>
<p begin="00:49:56.733" end="00:49:57.600" style="s2">Motion denied.</p>
<p begin="00:50:00.600" end="00:50:03.400" style="s2">Your Honor, in light of that ruling, the People move</p>
<p begin="00:50:03.400" end="00:50:05.266" style="s2">to dismiss the related case against</p>
<p begin="00:50:05.266" end="00:50:06.766" style="s2">Mr. Bennett and Mrs. Mayhew.</p>
<p begin="00:50:08.600" end="00:50:11.166" style="s2">So ordered. The charges are dismissed,</p>
<p begin="00:50:11.400" end="00:50:12.666" style="s2">and their bail is returned.</p>
<p begin="00:50:19.800" end="00:50:20.733" style="s2">Then let&#39;s look at what</p>
<p begin="00:50:20.733" end="00:50:22.200" style="s2">the footage actually shows, Your Honor.</p>
<p begin="00:50:22.633" end="00:50:24.366" style="s2">One person walks into that shed</p>
<p begin="00:50:24.366" end="00:50:25.866" style="s2">and touches that necklace.</p>
<p begin="00:50:25.866" end="00:50:26.600" style="s2">Ms. Lennox.</p>
<p begin="00:50:27.133" end="00:50:31.000" style="s2">Yes, she says “Spencer” on a phone call.</p>
<p begin="00:50:31.866" end="00:50:35.833" style="s2">Not a single frame shows my client touching that necklace.</p>
<p begin="00:50:37.066" end="00:50:39.633" style="s2">The affair, my client admits.</p>
<p begin="00:50:40.533" end="00:50:42.800" style="s2">The land is a contract dispute between</p>
<p begin="00:50:42.800" end="00:50:44.633" style="s2">a husband and wife, for another court.</p>
<p begin="00:50:45.366" end="00:50:46.400" style="s2">As for the fake...</p>
<p begin="00:50:48.366" end="00:50:51.266" style="s2">Picked up in September by Ms. Lennox herself.</p>
<p begin="00:50:51.833" end="00:50:52.633" style="s2">Her signature.</p>
<p begin="00:50:53.966" end="00:50:56.200" style="s2">Ms. Lennox has had an infatuation</p>
<p begin="00:50:56.200" end="00:50:57.866" style="s2">with my client since college—</p>
<p begin="00:50:58.200" end="00:50:59.033" style="s2">Since college.</p>
<p begin="00:51:01.800" end="00:51:04.133" style="s2">You held on to that slip for six weeks.</p>
<p begin="00:51:05.066" end="00:51:07.566" style="s2">You held on to that letter for sixteen years.</p>
<p begin="00:51:10.166" end="00:51:11.666" style="s2">Your Honor, I want to testify.</p>
<p begin="00:51:12.933" end="00:51:16.200" style="s2">Ms. Lennox, you&#39;re charged in this case too.</p>
<p begin="00:51:16.866" end="00:51:18.733" style="s2">Anything you say can be used against you.</p>
<p begin="00:51:19.166" end="00:51:20.066" style="s2">I understand.</p>
<p begin="00:51:27.333" end="00:51:28.400" style="s2">Sixteen years ago,</p>
<p begin="00:51:28.666" end="00:51:30.466" style="s2">I stood lookout while Spencer put</p>
<p begin="00:51:30.466" end="00:51:32.233" style="s2">his own watch in Luke Bennett&#39;s backpack.</p>
<p begin="00:51:33.466" end="00:51:35.200" style="s2">I told the dean I saw Luke take</p>
<p begin="00:51:35.200" end="00:51:36.833" style="s2">it because Spencer told me to.</p>
<p begin="00:51:38.833" end="00:51:40.633" style="s2">The letter Luke gave me for Hannah,</p>
<p begin="00:51:41.133" end="00:51:42.400" style="s2">I handed to Spencer.</p>
<p begin="00:51:44.466" end="00:51:47.400" style="s2">In September, Spencer sent me to pick up a box.</p>
<p begin="00:51:48.633" end="00:51:50.533" style="s2">He said it was Hannah&#39;s anniversary present.</p>
<p begin="00:51:54.333" end="00:51:55.833" style="s2">His text is still on there.</p>
<p begin="00:51:56.633" end="00:51:58.066" style="s2">“Pick it up tomorrow afternoon.</p>
<p begin="00:51:58.433" end="00:51:59.366" style="s2">Use your name.</p>
<p begin="00:51:59.566" end="00:52:00.533" style="s2">Don&#39;t open it.”</p>
<p begin="00:52:02.066" end="00:52:03.633" style="s2">He sent me the receipt too,</p>
<p begin="00:52:03.633" end="00:52:05.000" style="s2">so they&#39;d release the box.</p>
<p begin="00:52:05.666" end="00:52:07.066" style="s2">Paid from his company&#39;s account.</p>
<p begin="00:52:09.566" end="00:52:11.866" style="s2">That Saturday, Spencer handed me</p>
<p begin="00:52:11.866" end="00:52:13.466" style="s2">the necklace and told me which hook.</p>
<p begin="00:52:18.633" end="00:52:20.033" style="s2">The letter in that bag,</p>
<p begin="00:52:20.600" end="00:52:22.366" style="s2">I took it out and gave it to him.</p>
<p begin="00:52:23.333" end="00:52:25.166" style="s2">I was in that shed at 9:12.</p>
<p begin="00:52:25.633" end="00:52:27.733" style="s2">He called 911 at 9:05.</p>
<p begin="00:52:28.366" end="00:52:29.233" style="s2">“Calling my mom”?</p>
<p begin="00:52:30.466" end="00:52:31.800" style="s2">That call was to him.</p>
<p begin="00:52:37.533" end="00:52:40.000" style="s2">Last week, his lawyer brought me that sworn</p>
<p begin="00:52:40.166" end="00:52:41.800" style="s2">statement and told me where to sign.</p>
<p begin="00:52:42.633" end="00:52:44.266" style="s2">Spencer paid him to file it.</p>
<p begin="00:52:48.366" end="00:52:50.233" style="s2">He kept that letter sixteen years</p>
<p begin="00:52:50.233" end="00:52:51.833" style="s2">so he&#39;d have something on me.</p>
<p begin="00:52:52.866" end="00:52:55.866" style="s2">This time, I kept something too.</p>
<p begin="00:52:56.433" end="00:53:02.266" style="s2">Paige— Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:53:02.366" end="00:53:06.200" style="s2">Hale, I find reasonable cause to believe</p>
<p begin="00:53:06.200" end="00:53:08.000" style="s2">you tampered with a witness in this case.</p>
<p begin="00:53:08.866" end="00:53:10.266" style="s2">Your release is revoked.</p>
<p begin="00:53:10.866" end="00:53:12.400" style="s2">You&#39;re remanded into custody,</p>
<p begin="00:53:12.966" end="00:53:13.766" style="s2">effective immediately.</p>
<p begin="00:53:14.166" end="00:53:16.566" style="s2">The People will be filing additional charges, Your Honor.</p>
<p begin="00:53:16.733" end="00:53:18.733" style="s2">The theft of Mrs. Hale&#39;s necklace,</p>
<p begin="00:53:19.200" end="00:53:21.566" style="s2">and paying for a false sworn statement.</p>
<p begin="00:53:28.033" end="00:53:30.333" style="s2">Evidence. Sixteen years late.</p>
<p begin="00:53:34.566" end="00:53:35.366" style="s2">Hannah—</p>
<p begin="00:53:37.433" end="00:53:39.200" style="s2">You told me he left without a word.</p>
<p begin="00:53:39.833" end="00:53:41.000" style="s2">He left a whole letter,</p>
<p begin="00:53:41.166" end="00:53:42.433" style="s2">and you locked it away.</p>
<p begin="00:53:42.633" end="00:53:45.866" style="s2">Ten years, I signed whatever you put in front of me.</p>
<p begin="00:53:46.400" end="00:53:47.433" style="s2">From today on,</p>
<p begin="00:53:48.166" end="00:53:49.666" style="s2">I read every word first.</p>
<p begin="00:53:58.466" end="00:54:00.566" style="s2">Based on Ms. Lennox&#39;s sworn testimony,</p>
<p begin="00:54:01.233" end="00:54:02.733" style="s2">your record has been cleared.</p>
<p begin="00:54:03.766" end="00:54:06.000" style="s2">Northbrook owes you an apology, Mr. Bennett.</p>
<p begin="00:54:06.333" end="00:54:08.033" style="s2">And a chance to finish your degree.</p>
<p begin="00:54:08.800" end="00:54:09.833" style="s2">Full scholarship.</p>
<p begin="00:54:10.466" end="00:54:12.100" style="s2">Spring semester starts Monday.</p>
<p begin="00:54:13.333" end="00:54:14.433" style="s2">I&#39;m thirty-five.</p>
<p begin="00:54:14.666" end="00:54:16.366" style="s2">I&#39;ll be the oldest guy in every class.</p>
<p begin="00:54:16.600" end="00:54:17.733" style="s2">And the best prepared.</p>
<p begin="00:54:18.233" end="00:54:20.533" style="s2">Your old professors&#39; notes say you always were.</p>
<p begin="00:54:24.633" end="00:54:28.566" style="s2">Sixteen years I&#39;ve wanted to walk back into this room. ...Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:54:30.933" end="00:54:33.033" style="s2">Eat. Bridges don&#39;t build themselves.</p>
<p begin="00:54:34.866" end="00:54:36.266" style="s2">The divorce is final.</p>
<p begin="00:54:36.600" end="00:54:38.533" style="s2">And Kessler&#39;s contract is void.</p>
<p begin="00:54:38.833" end="00:54:40.266" style="s2">The land stays in the trust.</p>
<p begin="00:54:41.000" end="00:54:43.466" style="s2">Spencer took a plea. Nine years.</p>
<p begin="00:54:43.966" end="00:54:44.666" style="s2">At sentencing,</p>
<p begin="00:54:44.666" end="00:54:46.066" style="s2">the judge brought up that watch.</p>
<p begin="00:54:46.733" end="00:54:47.733" style="s2">Paige cooperated.</p>
<p begin="00:54:47.966" end="00:54:49.333" style="s2">She still got eighteen months.</p>
<p begin="00:54:51.200" end="00:54:52.733" style="s2">You can just sign it, you know.</p>
<p begin="00:54:53.200" end="00:54:54.600" style="s2">I read every word now.</p>
<p begin="00:54:57.833" end="00:54:59.166" style="s2">Henry would be proud of you.</p>
<p begin="00:55:01.033" end="00:55:02.233" style="s2">Sixteen years ago,</p>
<p begin="00:55:02.833" end="00:55:03.633" style="s2">in that letter,</p>
<p begin="00:55:03.633" end="00:55:04.966" style="s2">I asked you to meet me.</p>
<p begin="00:55:05.966" end="00:55:08.366" style="s2">Last day of the semester. Noon.</p>
<p begin="00:55:09.066" end="00:55:10.166" style="s2">On the stone bridge.</p>
<p begin="00:55:11.466" end="00:55:12.966" style="s2">I waited there till dark.</p>
<p begin="00:55:19.600" end="00:55:21.766" style="s2">For the shirt. With interest.</p>
<p begin="00:55:22.966" end="00:55:24.666" style="s2">Keep it. You earned it.</p>
<p begin="00:55:25.333" end="00:55:26.400" style="s2">Isn&#39;t that my line?</p>
<p begin="00:55:40.933" end="00:55:44.533" style="s2">“They&#39;re saying I stole Spencer&#39;s watch. I didn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:55:45.366" end="00:55:46.266" style="s2">I can&#39;t prove it,</p>
<p begin="00:55:46.266" end="00:55:49.366" style="s2">and I won&#39;t make you choose.</p>
<p begin="00:55:52.033" end="00:55:53.400" style="s2">But if you believe me,</p>
<p begin="00:55:54.033" end="00:55:55.800" style="s2">meet me on the stone bridge at noon</p>
<p begin="00:55:55.800" end="00:55:57.366" style="s2">on the last day of the semester.</p>
<p begin="00:55:59.033" end="00:56:00.166" style="s2">If you&#39;re not there,</p>
<p begin="00:56:00.166" end="00:56:01.233" style="s2">I&#39;ll know your answer,</p>
<p begin="00:56:01.600" end="00:56:03.366" style="s2">and I won&#39;t come looking for you.</p>
<p begin="00:56:04.033" end="00:56:06.466" style="s2">I love you. Luke.”</p>
<p begin="00:56:21.866" end="00:56:25.166" style="s2">You&#39;re early. Sixteen years ago,</p>
<p begin="00:56:25.166" end="00:56:26.400" style="s2">you waited here till dark.</p>
<p begin="00:56:27.133" end="00:56:28.400" style="s2">I&#39;ve finally read it.</p>
<p begin="00:56:30.366" end="00:56:32.000" style="s2">I can&#39;t give you those years back.</p>
<p begin="00:56:32.833" end="00:56:34.266" style="s2">But I can be here now.</p>
<p begin="00:56:35.166" end="00:56:36.566" style="s2">If you still want me here.</p>
<p begin="00:56:44.366" end="00:56:45.800" style="s2">Every winter on that sidewalk,</p>
<p begin="00:56:46.533" end="00:56:48.333" style="s2">this stayed at the bottom of my bag.</p>
<p begin="00:56:49.833" end="00:56:50.933" style="s2">You don&#39;t have to answer.</p>
<p begin="00:56:52.166" end="00:56:54.066" style="s2">I just wanted it to finally get to you.</p>
<p begin="00:56:55.366" end="00:56:58.466" style="s2">Then ask. This time I got here first.</p>
<p begin="00:57:01.533" end="00:57:02.866" style="s2">Hannah Caldwell, will you—</p>
<p begin="00:57:02.866" end="00:57:03.666" style="s2">Yes.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
